mit/8da0ccb139b8ccc4438a7522499a257a44f1cf19"}]},{"sha":"8da0ccb139b8ccc4438a7522499a257a44f1cf19","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDhkYTBjY2IxMzliOGNjYzQ0MzhhNzUyMjQ5OWEyNTdhNDRmMWNmMTk","commit":{"author":{"name":"John Kennedy","email":"65985482+jkennedyvz@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-25T07:32:40Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-25T07:32:40Z"},"message":"chore(talon): update vulnerable lockfile dependencies (#5062)\n\n## Summary\n- bump setuptools to 83.0.0 in affected uv locks to address\nGHSA-h35f-9h28-mq5c / CVE-2026-59890\n- bump brace-expansion to 2.1.2 in the Talon WhatsApp bridge package\nlock to address GHSA-3jxr-9vmj-r5cp / CVE-2026-13149\n- dismissed stale pyasn1 Dependabot alerts 720, 721, 722, and 723\nbecause their manifest paths no longer exist on main\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] `uv lock --project examples/deep_research --locked --offline`\n- [x] `uv lock --project examples/nvidia_deep_agent --locked --offline`\n- [x] `uv lock --project libs/evals --locked --offline`\n- [x] `uv lock --project libs/talon --locked --offline`\n- [x] `python3 -m json.tool\nlibs/talon/deepagents_talon/channels/whatsapp_bridge/package-lock.json`\n- [x] verify affected package versions in touched lockfiles\n\nNote: Socket Firewall could not initialize in this sandbox because its\nGitHub release binary download returned 502, so dependency lock updates\nwere applied from registry metadata and validated offline rather than\nvia package-manager network update commands.\n\nCo-authored-by: langsmith-fleet[bot] <langsmith-fleet[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f56512e2cb9c4a896db046024eb20b756d9041c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/f56512e2cb9c4a896db046024eb20b756d9041c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/8da0ccb139b8ccc4438a7522499a257a44f1cf19","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGN