perimental)` (#5037)\n\nShortens the startup splash experimental tag from `(experimental mode)`\nto `(experimental)` for a tighter label.\n\nUpdates the rendered tag in `WelcomeBanner`, related\ndocstrings/comments, and the corresponding `test_welcome` assertions.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/c4332777-a67e-0bf8-b9d6-d5e2356fc230)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"62acfcbe1ff24a1c6a9559433db56d0de6452a92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/62acfcbe1ff24a1c6a9559433db56d0de6452a92"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/9e6f480f4012ad3d868a61d5761a3749aa51a36b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYvuPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXZEQAHXNSRn3oSy9PejIXwRGJbBN\nWJALmQUIGa4eGGaqg1Sl/opEuhobvx4YjmJ9Jf/nZ615tWfMV3+RLdjQ9MYGu4J6\neEHXwWMiDtf5Y8juGHso64UkEnbAK0fa+JQnV7zmXYKSBlYhEohXTK6uy5iVLDoT\nj2g1VZ2N98iSUyuQobtVVWztCXd9PHQtzQ7odM9q7Hf9WooUV0fUlM+1vMfNkUcY\nBdUJXcD7i/SyotX03qdrd/l5q6UAKGe/U0wfpP/gDdh/N4kkqh8soD3k9wL+JH4N\nUzcmtycGkyxe/asieA3MhEtL/IPP7RH7UmE+BoCmU9DM/TCvDRaWj+O0sIEm/V/g\nWspXn0loPhJoOFdZJX8QKJKEQSaOnerZWsQTUA5G6I2uThcpCDTzLQEMP7oJ2/C3\n/ezjvKIeOJkIdGgJ8ivP2omFcS6CTz3tQ/J7wjtr4AV5LyvQnWNaT5lYPVRHMQnE\nlaZXISKjeQ4SAk5nrnVGZmJ+bHB/ynHeBX65ZSUUJTh1cuRspLv7F4OjQGlDP98L\n4PXvsgZq4dtfbn8rbVQSHcYInKYpVT38IOaG9kProOMo/G9ZQ55y1nRRJq2zHFdz\nbE6R2imbfyVGHRSbwJvFr6iWBnuKgn+by74RkeA0wD49Fsl8yvMNPyfVWzIsZ5Gd\nAHhozcCN9dZqUcI4mxcL\n=uZPi\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 62acfcbe1ff24a1c6a9559433db56d0de6452a92\nparent 9f2cc212dc3ba59540a9f738d2849e38ac9ecfc2\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784871823 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784871823 -0400\n\nstyle(code): shorten splash tag to `(experimental)` (#5037)\n\nShortens the startup splash experimental tag from `(experimental mode)`\nto `(experimental)` for a tighter label.\n\nUpdates the rendered tag in `WelcomeBanner`, related\ndocstrings/comments, and the corresponding `test_welcome` assertions.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/c4332777-a67e-0bf8-b9d6-d5e2356fc230)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-24T05:43:44Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9e6f480f4012ad3d868a61d5761a3749aa51a36b","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9e6f480f4012ad3d868a61d5761a3749aa51a36b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9e6f480f4012ad3d868a61d5761a3749aa51a36b/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"9f2cc212dc3ba59540a9f738d2849e38ac9ecfc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9f2cc212dc3ba59540a9f738d2849e38ac9ecfc2","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9f2cc212dc3ba59540a9f738d2849e38ac9ecfc2"}]},{"sha":"9f2cc212dc3ba59540a9f738d2849e38ac9ecfc2","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDlmMmNjMjEyZGMzYmE1OTU0MGE5ZjczOGQyODQ5ZTM4YWM5ZWNmYzI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-24T05:40:46Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-24T05:40:46Z"},"message":"feat(code): include `yolo` mode in `Shift+Tab` approval cycle (#5035)\n\nMake YOLO reachable from the interactive approval switcher so you do not\nneed to restart with `--yolo`.\n\nShift+Tab now cycles **Manual → Auto → YOLO → Manual** by default.\nOrganizations and cautious installs can remove YOLO from that cycle with\n`DEEPAGENTS_CODE_YOLO_SWITCHER=false` or `[startup].yolo_switcher =\nfalse` in a distributed `config.toml`. The first switcher entry into\nYOLO still requires the existing install-local acknowledgement used by\n`--yolo`; Esc keeps the current mode and does not enable unrestricted\nexecution.\n\nAuto remains skipped under sandboxes. Disabling the switcher keeps\nManual/Auto only, while a session already started with `--yolo` can\nstill leave YOLO with Shift+Tab.","tree":{"sha":"7eeacc7752d94e880a29b0bb76d27889c9e312fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/7eeacc7752d94e880a29b0bb76d27889c9e312fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/9f2cc212dc3ba59540a9f738d2849e38ac9ecfc2","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYvreCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4ikQAAcwkYhvFsgZloJ/Cddt3d0o\n2zyPYlyuTEKQShEr3G4zgEt/Zp2QslAtekFajav9avi7Vr+HJdAfTCvtZsSgn1YU\nr2sz8LDnZji/QZgz3Ca+5l4jPucZFdbfpmlkBx1NSfcMnCu5XFzOfdUTJ6BigVYS\nANw8NvqEBK6z/70oI/fXG+hk089aETBgUwPXJ1iuJNmsY9f4JbtR1POYDCnZo3jt\nPiQH8cY+CKDgy9AVPpuw+3404wXw+VSalapr60k/U8Rfc6njB3PTWIurgF7q78pQ\nwTlP3p6JmRPeOolnGCvZMtibw+TtuYml6FobjIQ4q79su879UiNgCTozk/oVa8bl\nFD5zkYyd5eC0hfdNdoRWXGqr9X6YlANyLGhZyjj/H8p11cBmXDJ2198jhbxG0C43\nAZXnQ3BQMdPI4MTnEKvuGpFb6ND/TNJwCjHIy8v69hULVJK6S26ECIrJ0cXOhWCa\ng/R5RiI9s9VLYQeRKOM1rozBSs9cxIexiHlo9FiR3zwg06+936/dYzqHpQa7xYRf\n2bQfVoRJxACzBh0m1IEaFz1C3UMSusIYpKxX2yBSyjhzMn8U1lq3TU15/QmZRgDt\nWz7FYkwT4/3F2gcWgjllAZi7X4K7z7cQ/FDCCbcwJA9UFvTRfPCSCwPj+PxASO/J\nodmtIzTPbflfJDBzDar0\n=HnX0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 7eeacc7752d94e880a29b0bb76d27889c9e312fb\nparent 723ef8a501eaafee281ca0523b5d22f6c7077b17\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784871646 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784871646 -0400\n\nfeat(code): include `yolo` mode in `Shift+Tab` approval cycle (#5035)\n\nMake YOLO reachable from the interactive approval switcher so you do not\nneed to restart with `--yolo`.\n\nShift+Tab now cycles **Manual → Auto → YOLO → Manual** by default.\nOrganizations and cautious installs can remove YOLO from that cycle with\n`DEEPAGENTS_CODE_YOLO_SWITCHER=false` or `[startup].yolo_switcher =\nfalse` in a distributed `config.toml`. The first switcher entry into\nYOLO still requires the existing install-local acknowledgement used by\n`--yolo`; Esc keeps the current mode and does not enable unrestricted\nexecution.\n\nAuto remains skipped under sandboxes. Disabling the switcher keeps\nManual/Auto only, while a session already started with `--yolo` can\nstill leave YOLO with Shift+Tab.","verified_at":"2026-07-24T05:40:46Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9f2cc212dc3ba59540a9f738d2849e38ac9ecfc2","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/9f2cc212dc3ba59540a9f738d2849e38ac9ecfc2","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/9f2cc212dc3ba59540a9f738d2849e38ac9ecfc2/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"723ef8a501eaafee281ca0523b5d22f6c7077b17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/723ef8a501eaafee281ca0523b5d22f6c7077b17","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/723ef8a501eaafee281ca0523b5d22f6c7077b17"}]},{"sha":"723ef8a501eaafee281ca0523b5d22f6c7077b17","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDcyM2VmOGE1MDFlYWFmZWUyODFjYTA1MjNiNWQyMmY2YzcwNzdiMTc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-24T04:47:01Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-24T04:47:01Z"},"message":"ci(infra): clarify release PR bot and pin check copy (#5033)\n\nClarify release PR and release-bot copy so maintainers get clearer\nguidance on note hygiene, prerelease SDK pins, and next steps.\n\n---\n\nMakes release PR surface copy more actionable:\n\n- **Release-please PR header** — explain *why* the notes preview should\nstay in sync with `CHANGELOG.md` even though publish uses the merged\nchangelog: the PR body remains the historical record for reviewers and\nlater readers.\n- **Curated notes draft comment** — visible horizontal rules around the\neditable content markers, prefer copyable fenced code blocks for\n`@dcode-release-bot apply` / `draft`, and clearer wording for the\ncurated-notes gate bypass label.\n- **Curated notes check** — when notes are ready for review, link the\nbot draft comment and put the apply command in a code block.\n- **Prerelease SDK pin warning** — drop the misleading “this is allowed”\nframing; treat `release-deps: acknowledged` as an explicit\nacknowledgement before merge (and note that it also covers\ndeps/freshness failures common for unpublished prerelease SDK pins).\n\nAffects future release PR automation/text only; does not change an\nalready-open release PR body/comments until they are regenerated.","tree":{"sha":"88a28b7b95a3b3af715858892fcb1d3ad639937b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/88a28b7b95a3b3af715858892fcb1d3ad639937b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/723ef8a501eaafee281ca0523b5d22f6c7077b17","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYu5FCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiI0QAIMTMZj7enHrr/MYfAQjQNcG\nkhENV9kTl1kYItrifiA7KvSvX4X/0bw1gpuTUeH2F0GkInfr8rOEzecrNGb93X7v\nedP8ZyAg0qAUZP4m0Bg/De5D3gzHtoCgS4wdlqYx5VrKDVXNUOAx95qb84r0FLLj\nWhMa4wsLzlHS7Ta1XrwhegOjMpPNKibzvkqTXJNooEjS7XZvqd/m2XiNjjvJcK6e\n1hs97K9iYWVl3Yv50GKbR2AHuhYEKNzF94lla+pGQkwSNco/YVVd21srAgUraCKI\nOOOEgW22duxi2KAFFJqsr5WlBIdtZCByr7DITWnwA0H3YjXnkLtMirzcDjNyMhaY\nkboSlN2Ay/EbNjgY29mI28WKfO2CocyIofIRcBeAi6LnpdU+mf64D9Opb216lqNC\nffez3UYcWL1g6xUf0VMWeoun0VWrG6mpxbTFvJuQhldOQ6XlyAqt65FV++nbvym3\nWzvhxXEHtU6WpwF7acB7dMLynZKUoQxPY/So+JFQUtAw/qkj2R0UbkzDO1RVrsHW\nAJIvdDIKPrzULfWnK9fTOVR3iNue4tvMr/iI05q2dc2Pcu+HhO40gFmRlbeQytRt\nAKSD4ecH73dWhp7QpQF5686HD12Rab3Ua3GOtmjeIMHO3HsWBnCsuQu9Fh/7q3n7\nM2nhvzpxTjm5jRWsmRQV\n=p15y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 88a28b7b95a3b3af715858892fcb1d3ad639937b\nparent 7a105a355752e4a6ae11038fa8eb9ebc393bcc6c\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784868421 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784868421 -0400\n\nci(infra): clarify release PR bot and pin check copy (#5033)\n\nClarify release PR and release-bot copy so maintainers get clearer\nguidance on note hygiene, prerelease SDK pins, and next steps.\n\n---\n\nMakes release PR surface copy more actionable:\n\n- **Release-please PR header** — explain *why* the notes preview should\nstay in sync with `CHANGELOG.md` even though publish uses the merged\nchangelog: the PR body remains the historical record for reviewers and\nlater readers.\n- **Curated notes draft comment** — visible horizontal rules around the\neditable content markers, prefer copyable fenced code blocks for\n`@dcode-release-bot apply` / `draft`, and clearer wording for the\ncurated-notes gate bypass label.\n- **Curated notes check** — when notes are ready for review, link the\nbot draft comment and put the apply command in a code block.\n- **Prerelease SDK pin warning** — drop the misleading “this is allowed”\nframing; treat `release-deps: acknowledged` as an explicit\nacknowledgement before merge (and note that it also covers\ndeps/freshness failures common for unpublished prerelease SDK pins).\n\nAffects future release PR automation/text only; does not change an\nalready-open release PR body/comments until they are regenerated.","verified_at":"2026-07-24T04:47:01Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/723ef8a501eaafee281ca0523b5d22f6c7077b17","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/723ef8a501eaafee281ca0523b5d22f6c7077b17","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/723ef8a501eaafee281ca0523b5d22f6c7077b17/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/u