dmin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"efa86c51fedd8d6fbcbabe7da36dd4d63661103c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/efa86c51fedd8d6fbcbabe7da36dd4d63661103c","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/efa86c51fedd8d6fbcbabe7da36dd4d63661103c"}]},{"sha":"efa86c51fedd8d6fbcbabe7da36dd4d63661103c","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGVmYTg2YzUxZmVkZDhkNmZiY2JhYmU3ZGEzNmRkNGQ2MzY2MTEwM2M","commit":{"author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-24T04:24:51Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-24T04:24:51Z"},"message":"release(deepagents-code): 0.1.46 (#4965)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Release notes preview: keep this section in sync with the package\n`CHANGELOG.md`. The published GitHub release body is extracted from the\nmerged `CHANGELOG.md` by `release.yml`, not from this PR description._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.46](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.45...deepagents-code==0.1.46)\n(2026-07-24)\n\n### Highlights\n\n- Auto mode is now generally available.\n[#4957](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4957)\n- Added configurable Auto goal-criteria acceptance.\n[#4940](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4940)\n- Improved Auto behavior by authorizing actions from active goal/rubric\ndirectives, avoiding redundant approval prompts, showing the enable\nnotice only on first global enable, deduplicating classifier-unavailable\ntranscript spam, logging underlying classifier failures, and reporting\nclassifier timeout budgets.\n[#5017](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5017)\n[#4993](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4993)\n[#5012](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5012)\n[#5013](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5013)\n[#5011](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5011)\n[#5025](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5025)\n- Added Hooks v2 capability snapshots and session transcripts, and\nhardened Hooks v2 command execution.\n[#4916](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4916)\n[#4918](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4918)\n[#4917](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4917)\n- Raised the agent recursion limit to 2000 and made it configurable.\n[#4994](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4994)\n\n### Improvements and fixes\n\n- Let the rubric grader inspect working-directory files, show rubric\ngrader defaults, and improved `/rubric` help and empty-state messaging.\n[#4835](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4835)\n[#4966](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4966)\n[#5015](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5015)\n- Unified goal activation signaling.\n[#4980](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4980)\n- Made Version, Model, and CWD copyable in the Debug Console.\n[#4975](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4975)\n- Improved `config get` output when a key is missing.\n[#4976](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4976)\n- Aborted YOLO launch on `Ctrl+C`/`Ctrl+D` and made the YOLO warning\nfriendlier for new users.\n[#4953](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4953)\n[#4950](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4950)\n- Updated LangSmith handling: secret redaction is disabled by default,\n`/trace` now flags empty env overrides that shadow the LangSmith key,\nand the default US endpoint is no longer treated as a custom target.\n[#4970](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4970)\n[#4996](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4996)\n[#5022](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5022)\n- Injected OpenAI `prompt_cache_key` for any OpenAI-provider endpoint.\n[#4995](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4995)\n- Improved tool and schema presentation: finished calls stay on the live\ntool-group line, first-party tool schemas now include field\ndescriptions, and `web_search`/`fetch_url` tool descriptions were\ntrimmed. [#4927](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4927)\n[#5019](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5019)\n[#5016](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5016)\n- Omitted `plugins/` and `conversation_history/` from the `/agent`\npicker. [#4991](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4991)\n- Made selector modal backdrop dimming consistent.\n[#4990](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4990)\n- Restored the `\"Server log preserved at:\"` notice on exit.\n[#4999](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4999)\n- Used the SDK pin as the effective editable version.\n[#4949](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4949)\n\n_End release notes preview._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot] <248757908+langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"fce5a7ea383f85c1cfe985b2d9e234d9935d7959","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/fce5a7ea383f85c1cfe985b2d9e234d9935d7959"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/efa86c51fedd8d6fbcbabe7da36dd4d63661103c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYukTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA26wQAEHiOeBUzbWaSgfrMFXTgNzv\nIy/Emn1fpY3OSInOdO9Wneluna2U7lmM8cKbB/s7oTjeatrd5X9MfUazyM6rChDf\nUdvXBWmFY6LrWEvBrm1yqaHhtlX9HXKHbH0jgPTsI2ZsNJOa4gmc/LgKTu6fo6pl\n0GBWAvHZNEf3o5nw/4pQboXr3RQuSaLqxtImN/mmfaF5Jqz7JRDiDDj0kMylcPz9\nE1RKstDFAB2VUPv2WT2bnTaBcQzO1LsRaUSd759oUozhLKJUG12XgDCLOLnSqmK9\nca6ALrDLWIv1kfsKw8Yp0oVa+Vh9GPI3dGNke64qDcdL/bpaJmsOELXDopGnFCpy\n9QUUrxjYW11Ulx/eyJdSeDtSl6veluEqbXS1jokiPlncnF5CjEftxZMSK8DX4ASi\nqtvh7FegYc7Rh1KGsUrRIRECGx6GSs3f9WXuGtIkI9+sPxfxZ3z3askkY9nMtVSU\nchhmU6RC89M9DFIOwm4NlmrhHtXX6Ykrvfr2bvqzstfPV5XS2kte7N1cRWKD3/5W\nDK0tu15IhjqD8kjHOSHnM01yKWovPP8+YDK8UVw7Cm+gHa8kOmSC9dEzMQILw0HD\ne+kN0n+hkyhaa+IybXeXn71V0cc3/nugnqrxZ3vMxArO92sENNDzzKtN5I2NgAAr\nQ+AFNEegSNDhhY+2b4bE\n=7j9O\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree fce5a7ea383f85c1cfe985b2d9e234d9935d7959\nparent e1b1303c06083f2dd179e0081029b5574e0b8a05\nauthor github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1784867091 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784867091 -0400\n\nrelease(deepagents-code): 0.1.46 (#4965)\n\n> [!CAUTION]\n> Merging this PR will automatically publish to **PyPI** and create a\n**GitHub release**.\n\nFor the full release process, see\n[`.github/RELEASING.md`](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md).\n\n---\n\n_Release notes preview: keep this section in sync with the package\n`CHANGELOG.md`. The published GitHub release body is extracted from the\nmerged `CHANGELOG.md` by `release.yml`, not from this PR description._\n\n---\n\n\n##\n[0.1.46](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/compare/deepagents-code==0.1.45...deepagents-code==0.1.46)\n(2026-07-24)\n\n### Highlights\n\n- Auto mode is now generally available.\n[#4957](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4957)\n- Added configurable Auto goal-criteria acceptance.\n[#4940](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4940)\n- Improved Auto behavior by authorizing actions from active goal/rubric\ndirectives, avoiding redundant approval prompts, showing the enable\nnotice only on first global enable, deduplicating classifier-unavailable\ntranscript spam, logging underlying classifier failures, and reporting\nclassifier timeout budgets.\n[#5017](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5017)\n[#4993](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4993)\n[#5012](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5012)\n[#5013](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5013)\n[#5011](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5011)\n[#5025](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5025)\n- Added Hooks v2 capability snapshots and session transcripts, and\nhardened Hooks v2 command execution.\n[#4916](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4916)\n[#4918](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4918)\n[#4917](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4917)\n- Raised the agent recursion limit to 2000 and made it configurable.\n[#4994](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4994)\n\n### Improvements and fixes\n\n- Let the rubric grader inspect working-directory files, show rubric\ngrader defaults, and improved `/rubric` help and empty-state messaging.\n[#4835](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4835)\n[#4966](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4966)\n[#5015](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5015)\n- Unified goal activation signaling.\n[#4980](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4980)\n- Made Version, Model, and CWD copyable in the Debug Console.\n[#4975](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4975)\n- Improved `config get` output when a key is missing.\n[#4976](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4976)\n- Aborted YOLO launch on `Ctrl+C`/`Ctrl+D` and made the YOLO warning\nfriendlier for new users.\n[#4953](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4953)\n[#4950](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4950)\n- Updated LangSmith handling: secret redaction is disabled by default,\n`/trace` now flags empty env overrides that shadow the LangSmith key,\nand the default US endpoint is no longer treated as a custom target.\n[#4970](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4970)\n[#4996](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4996)\n[#5022](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5022)\n- Injected OpenAI `prompt_cache_key` for any OpenAI-provider endpoint.\n[#4995](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4995)\n- Improved tool and schema presentation: finished calls stay on the live\ntool-group line, first-party tool schemas now include field\ndescriptions, and `web_search`/`fetch_url` tool descriptions were\ntrimmed. [#4927](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4927)\n[#5019](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5019)\n[#5016](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/5016)\n- Omitted `plugins/` and `conversation_history/` from the `/agent`\npicker. [#4991](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4991)\n- Made selector modal backdrop dimming consistent.\n[#4990](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4990)\n- Restored the `\"Server log preserved at:\"` notice on exit.\n[#4999](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4999)\n- Used the SDK pin as the effective editable version.\n[#4949](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/issues/4949)\n\n_End release notes preview._\n\n---\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> A **New Contributors** section is appended to the GitHub release notes\nautomatically at publish time (see [Release\nPipeline](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/blob/main/.github/RELEASING.md#release-pipeline),\nstep 2).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot] <248757908+langchain-oss-automated-triage[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-24T04:24:52Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/efa86c51fedd8d6fbcbabe7da36dd4d63661103c","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/efa86c51fedd8d6fbcbabe7da36dd4d63661103c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/efa86c51fedd8d6fbcbabe7da36dd4d63661103c/comments","author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e1b1303c06083f2dd179e0081029b5574e0b8a05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e1b1303c06083f2dd179e0081029b5574e0b8a05","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e1b1303c06083f2dd179e0081029b5574e0b8a05"}]},{"sha":"e1b1303c06083f2dd179e0081029b5574e0b8a05","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGUxYjEzMDNjMDYwODNmMmRkMTc5ZTAwODEwMjliNTU3NGUwYjhhMDU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-24T04:08:03Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-24T04:08:03Z"},"message":"chore(code): bump SDK pin to `0.7.0b2` and dependency minimums (#5031)\n\nPins Deep Agents Code to `deepagents==0.7.0b2` and refreshes dependency\nlower bounds so installs stay on current supported releases.\n\n---\n\nKeeps the code package aligned with the published 0.7 beta SDK line and\nbumps package minima that have newer stable releases:\n\n- `langchain-anthropic` `1.5.1`\n- `langchain-openai` `1.4.1`\n- `langchain-fireworks` `1.5.1`\n- `ruff` `0.16.0`\n\nLeft intentionally unchanged:\n\n- `filelock` still capped below `3.30` for the blocking import probe\n- `ty` still pinned below `0.0.62` because newer releases panic during\nfull-package typecheck\n- `pydantic` stays on the `2.12` line because `fireworks-ai` still\nrequires `pydantic<2.13`","tree":{"sha":"e0838e7793c08c4f7b4bf5f108f1dd15fbc3642f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/e0838e7793c08c4f7b4bf5f108f1dd15fbc3642f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/e1b1303c06083f2dd179e0081029b5574e0b8a05","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYuUjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8gIQABWEXt3hBGGbvNUa6QTtIpqX\nQshBDkK3LVSM0RcuOLWbuAeqrPX/xNgdOaZIH95+5y7APG87IQjWuUSBIS/G+mTf\n7GTeVEoSm+YLi/Q3DOLkhWD4OE2KU723VqIAr281kiajsMfY8yGcVY25PSPpECyw\nrvepfhOR9YE1wYrJPKBcBwl0whPX7hcHfR/k5YiI2fCqekNoPuk2TwPtaF0mlwON\neRx6sHGAX0tQcAh6OdcsSaA26wlVGfeNrZ6GE7KbcIAv7kO0TvdPD6CfoGjxFubk\nwups1EYThoUrn3Za8HAlZN8nsWrY0U9mMcc9pMCTwZgtFD9YK/M+ydRKoMy7z3CD\nojp0J/8ojMwYtSxHEDSR4T3sJQbbLsRwMTqyCzHOOzoTo6d46W/ifG9+wcWM7ErE\nOMkOus3JDCvdbPe+THqb/pQMpTcMkjrj5wNk/50qbGh3M5EZ1VXcxrcTmvFpIJxe\nlzdacMktIOr2SFWeFlNh8jVhLlvVHS8UsNYOmcGnRqarmrNazl3jrdUeGy5e8M+C\nD/gW17s8dJj5JRf6TXoGqmIfGd9B6EP4P2TT+p+YsKupj8EOr/U4yMZDCXumcItz\nMNMRRrQTh3+CvrE/tjHHi8pgu4AktyzVgFyMK88RT5XL140CY7alHXwjoPcfCh6T\nRAfMKpXzw1RNVOp8iSB4\n=qcaw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree e0838e7793c08c4f7b4bf5f108f1dd15fbc3642f\nparent 516619b7bf516e56f0e56ebc319dcab928c68c40\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784866083 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784866083 -0400\n\nchore(code): bump SDK pin to `0.7.0b2` and dependency minimums (#5031)\n\nPins Deep Agents Code to `deepagents==0.7.0b2` and refreshes dependency\nlower bounds so installs stay on current supported releases.\n\n---\n\nKeeps the code package aligned with the published 0.7 beta SDK line and\nbumps package minima that have newer stable releases:\n\n- `langchain-anthropic` `1.5.1`\n- `langchain-openai` `1.4.1`\n- `langchain-fireworks` `1.5.1`\n- `ruff` `0.16.0`\n\nLeft intentionally unchanged:\n\n- `filelock` still capped below `3.30` for the blocking import probe\n- `ty` still pinned below `0.0.62` because newer releases panic during\nfull-package typecheck\n- `pydantic` stays on the `2.12` line because `fireworks-ai` still\nrequires `pydantic<2.13`","verified_at":"2026-07-24T04:08:03Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e1b1303c06083f2dd179e0081029b5574e0b8a05","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/e1b1303c06083f2dd179e0081029b5574e0b8a05","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/e1b1303c06083f2dd179e0081029b5574e0b8a05/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"516619b7bf516e56f0e56ebc319dcab928c68c40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/516619b7bf516e56f0e56ebc319dcab928c68c40","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/516619b7bf516e56f0e56ebc319dcab928c68c40"}]},{"sha":"516619b7bf516e56f0e56ebc319dcab928c68c40","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDUxNjYxOWI3YmY1MTZlNTZmMGU1NmViYzMxOWRjYWI5MjhjNjhjNDA","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-24T03:50:59Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-24T03:50:59Z"},"message":"fix(code): report Auto classifier timeout budget (#5025)\n\nWhen Auto mode's authorization classifier hits its 20s deadline, denials\nnow say it timed out after that budget instead of only showing\n`TimeoutError`.\n\n---\n\nOther classifier failures stay type-only in the agent/UI so raw provider\ntext does not leak into transcript reasons; timeout is special-cased\nbecause the limit is ours and useful for diagnosis.","tree":{"sha":"c1fd68a3a2b102d2d82d5b4217b6a9bd2f2baee9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/c1fd68a3a2b102d2d82d5b4217b6a9bd2f2baee9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/516619b7bf516e56f0e56ebc319dcab928c68c40","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYuEjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8QIQAA9XEw+n87L+UzyVLxFQpgSq\n+AzTYMvusVC2uLyteIfZ6Vzel22NPBc3sMEPU0h3AqhMlLizz062p/vkBayBEmY2\n/DhNyPiKoWDoWL41ZM/3J12bvTkYDqkwEs6HfjYV8SU0Y4JpvvfgP/jRdRPQnTFE\n0O2PYtV9WnoSx+w25QFFqh1pJS+jWru4PZ6LogG64fZu+VmOPXV1UR1lRTwADF4J\nvry0GF1TNAngeKqX2C8Cj15a4PLFXc/lJMXp/8U4n06fKPiawlq0PkDhExgexgOc\n1Di9UGENdjlmqkptD78L0nQ2PzU4vaZqZtt6cmbP6AluPDBVNNoe1TrSbm8WuFSX\n+Aks7sLVsoc2K41ZKI4okUNwaQVGEjStEPurMHQy4ydObXIomtuzOvXtozqEeZFv\nbHL9e1IO7vy8adOrXuVBK0yoxjFH2RfKNzcoDVu0OYmahS+D8NkQpYnfP5A7PFEm\npzD8oGIRcvXDGSYkeYbKSZrKeJ+8OEIqub1n/KjIj4Je5Ds4A2THPtGBJpOIwVAc\nEvnlWlRK0nEVLm/KqZXRU+OcUPbkJuMjVMZxZ98uQNUryoWSWMy7MXxhElMA2DCE\n5UdYOMa6t7awGg+hn9kk2w7s7Jn7EsIii3EXXH3SgMVa5EuiJfv7cB7MBLIQXVTK\nHxsAs7S4JVmZiHiQbQ5U\n=BnS4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree c1fd68a3a2b102d2d82d5b4217b6a9bd2f2baee9\nparent a9e9b966d4ab6d95c0f9f73e18b40942e9b569f9\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784865059 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784865059 -0400\n\nfix(code): report Auto classifier timeout budget (#5025)\n\nWhen Auto mode's authorization classifier hits its 20s deadline, denials\nnow say it timed out after that budget instead of only showing\n`TimeoutError`.\n\n---\n\nOther classifier failures stay type-only in the agent/UI so raw provider\ntext does not leak into transcript reasons; timeout is special-cased\nbecause the limit is ours and useful for diagnosis.","verified_at":"2026-07-24T03:50:59Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/516619b7bf516e56f0e56ebc319dcab928c68c40","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/516619b7bf516e56f0e56ebc319dcab928c68c40","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/516619b7bf516e56f0e56ebc319dcab928c68c40/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"a9e9b966d4ab6d95c0f9f73e18b40942e9b569f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/a9e9b966d4ab6d95c0f9f73e18b40942e9b569f9","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/a9e9b966d4ab6d95c0f9f73e18b40942e9b569f9"}]},{"sha":"a9e9b966d4ab6d95c0f9f73e18b40942e9b569f9","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKGE5ZTliOTY2ZDRhYjZkOTVjMGY5ZjczZTE4YjQwOTQyZTliNTY5Zjk","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-24T03:42:13Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-24T03:42:13Z"},"message":"hotfix(infra): pin `deepagents-code` next release to `0.1.46` (#5028)\n\nPins the next `deepagents-code` release at `0.1.46` so release-please\nstops treating #4929's breaking `!` as a `0.2.0` cut for code.\n\n---\n\n`#4929` landed as `feat(sdk,code,quickjs)!…`, and pre-1.0 minor-on-break\npolicy rewrote [release PR\n#4965](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/pull/4965) to `0.2.0`.\nThis temporary `\"release-as\": \"0.1.46\"` override on the code package\nforces the next code release back onto the `0.1.x` line without changing\nthe SDK bump path.\n\nRemove this key in a follow-up immediately after release-please rewrites\n#4965 to `0.1.46`, or every later code release will stay pinned.","tree":{"sha":"cdef5ea9dfa326c67436f5c70cde107fb85fcbe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/cdef5ea9dfa326c67436f5c70cde107fb85fcbe9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/a9e9b966d4ab6d95c0f9f73e18b40942e9b569f9","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYt8VCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxcEQAIpUhQxDGdOQoKPckdEpOTF4\nCFnoUOprrWgE486Wut2DS7vhNoqMjDfmaBPmI9P0+cVh7Df8Il5CdM2MXHzolZDJ\nq6v4RXCBWlMDQ+pq8iYsjhxb6tlx6uPHv14v4G1lRRXo1ifm6GC/npfc8RPBpLsH\ntu3sktGAr6Egcv+kb4s69tyi/ELwOKxAmJvdS1N2DlnfGwTSEy6uwzGgKaprl7yh\nkqEo6OAev/CuGQ+QsjuIze7/Wx6sWjvrZ2f88nqg/8PtO0rJkKRbqkfH3H+77MJk\nvpYCGHGwernLTb4DFYngxTGkbZxtyjW/n516RLyS7/emZqTLR6tjIZVAj+JWN4mc\n8LiSiz9BTrn892tbkwosJsUCn42zSqCEVEQ6iw8EgjnkGCXnXa4dBj//tRsh4MYf\nWxLmEZm/+HZc4LMeJgocC6OYNkNmc370e18TyXvuvsjbQehTlfLrbllBFTan8Mf5\nOxs09GjYi1q/wfQl/NDFKk9Nb4cGFmDYeGBiHhn4xiMXQVVRWToBDme5rAY99sSk\nQb6cdL8OzRqMTookhRfJZzI7e3Ufg+hkHistXLPHyh4BPkSsVpjKhrHYEq+GDaBh\nx+DBD0c89Xqs/K4VcN1r1/TOduVX6l+ln3WfEXpX3rQ6SnoPT9IfLdBv9KX5J6N2\nkpPwmOW97PmiyXHb4pf5\n=mpv4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree cdef5ea9dfa326c67436f5c70cde107fb85fcbe9\nparent 5dbedcdd3c71f4a34a3c5560f85ddb90e746e1c2\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784864533 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784864533 -0400\n\nhotfix(infra): pin `deepagents-code` next release to `0.1.46` (#5028)\n\nPins the next `deepagents-code` release at `0.1.46` so release-please\nstops treating #4929's breaking `!` as a `0.2.0` cut for code.\n\n---\n\n`#4929` landed as `feat(sdk,code,quickjs)!…`, and pre-1.0 minor-on-break\npolicy rewrote [release PR\n#4965](https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/pull/4965) to `0.2.0`.\nThis temporary `\"release-as\": \"0.1.46\"` override on the code package\nforces the next code release back onto the `0.1.x` line without changing\nthe SDK bump path.\n\nRemove this key in a follow-up immediately after release-please rewrites\n#4965 to `0.1.46`, or every later code release will stay pinned.","verified_at":"2026-07-24T03:42:14Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/a9e9b966d4ab6d95c0f9f73e18b40942e9b569f9","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/a9e9b966d4ab6d95c0f9f73e18b40942e9b569f9","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/a9e9b966d4ab6d95c0f9f73e18b40942e9b569f9/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"5dbedcdd3c71f4a34a3c5560f85ddb90e746e1c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/5dbedcdd3c71f4a34a3c5560f85ddb90e746e1c2","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/5dbedcdd3c71f4a34a3c5560f85ddb90e746e1c2"}]},{"sha":"5dbedcdd3c71f4a34a3c5560f85ddb90e746e1c2","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDVkYmVkY2RkM2M3MWY0YTM0YTNjNTU2MGY4NWRkYjkwZTc0NmUxYzI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-24T03:35:04Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-24T03:35:04Z"},"message":"docs(code): document dev vs GA tracing projects (#4973)\n\nDuring Engine onboarding for a tracing project, active-dev runs against\nthe shared GA project (`shared-deepagents-code`) generate false-positive\nSlack alerts and triage noise. This adds a `libs/code/DEVELOPMENT.md`\nsection instructing developers to route local traces to a dev-scoped\nproject via `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_LANGSMITH_PROJECT`, keeping Engine alerts\non the GA project high-signal, and to capture a project's nature (prod\nvs staging/dev) when onboarding it to Engine.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/68739307-7bfe-491a-9b30-e501958884f4)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7ec63bbe203586bea8ef749819dd3d844d5b24f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/7ec63bbe203586bea8ef749819dd3d844d5b24f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/5dbedcdd3c71f4a34a3c5560f85ddb90e746e1c2","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYt1oCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2KUQAB9DyPw9rf9T/imWRQfs7tB2\nU4XY+54rGQPC9t702nJiNXy+8lKT5HTRbfrbEOZZ0vr5n3bTmCM9z4ngR5GmAubj\nyZQ01D5wFDytqEAxzGgpnLF4dl3AUILRzxhe6lSRISa8+siRlhhreKygkqumBPBz\nzWlO6dyIy0Ov3XR1QTG/sL5XebNV2iRAl6Q0Zs3t3naLXYAFkqG5A0u49xU4UBua\nCpTEoeXYPwpjkNMZ4up9jn8SVVwHL/T8MPLYHut77enJnBN6BOqdP/1KwUau4/q7\nzKWyEZhNx+7jbP64CdWzJtAXc025FzX1npEeDF2FW8xfm/4+xq8PmNmKQ0m5DTxt\nPM3bhtYjag+iqoea1NRAECBENCDfilFP33kW+d6Huacdv27YFkhWfROutK39Y9Kw\nwRdEOS/ETci+kQpu8D2LonXCLtitxvwFjQkeglN83oxUUIKhhPAnarspWxsZSuev\nIAMrXZ5U9Ml9/90Pi+Wl1vMpqD4vjbZCuj+rjYdhJMKVmGDJ3iksPmxm7w7RUb68\nXoWLgh4NzzzEgpd5E9YHEjg3vwhkB6oTWosGD2cujfUXwrEQ+9XbAoSIDfb4BNRk\nunTKeQvvqtoc1wQVWZM3IJJ38S3knSxbB6zZqH8LmDxKJTzuCb5ncgu9R/moVwNZ\n3+eZ21OF/cohCIri2/o7\n=prVn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 7ec63bbe203586bea8ef749819dd3d844d5b24f7\nparent 170b4a6c4590b3f95fb5219b5d9074c7f01a1937\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784864104 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784864104 -0400\n\ndocs(code): document dev vs GA tracing projects (#4973)\n\nDuring Engine onboarding for a tracing project, active-dev runs against\nthe shared GA project (`shared-deepagents-code`) generate false-positive\nSlack alerts and triage noise. This adds a `libs/code/DEVELOPMENT.md`\nsection instructing developers to route local traces to a dev-scoped\nproject via `DEEPAGENTS_CODE_LANGSMITH_PROJECT`, keeping Engine alerts\non the GA project high-signal, and to capture a project's nature (prod\nvs staging/dev) when onboarding it to Engine.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/68739307-7bfe-491a-9b30-e501958884f4)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-24T03:35:04Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/5dbedcdd3c71f4a34a3c5560f85ddb90e746e1c2","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/5dbedcdd3c71f4a34a3c5560f85ddb90e746e1c2","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/5dbedcdd3c71f4a34a3c5560f85ddb90e746e1c2/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https