:"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"260c33ee28ade91741ba226ef3e719b6b8c8c02c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/260c33ee28ade91741ba226ef3e719b6b8c8c02c","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/260c33ee28ade91741ba226ef3e719b6b8c8c02c"}]},{"sha":"260c33ee28ade91741ba226ef3e719b6b8c8c02c","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDI2MGMzM2VlMjhhZGU5MTc0MWJhMjI2ZWYzZTcxOWI2YjhjOGMwMmM","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-24T00:30:50Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-24T00:30:50Z"},"message":"fix(code): give `config get` a useful missing-key message (#4976)\n\nRunning `dcode config get` with no key now prints a hint that names an\nexample key and points at `dcode config` / `dcode config --verbose` to\ndiscover available keys, instead of argparse's terse \"the following\narguments are required: key\".\n\n---\n\nThe `key` positional on `config get` is now optional so the command\nhandler is reached even when it's omitted. In that case it renders a\nhuman-friendly hint (text) or returns the full key list under `error:\nmissing key` (JSON), mirroring the existing unknown-key guidance. The\nexit code stays `2`, matching argparse's prior usage-error convention so\nscripts see no change. A test guards that the example key in the hint\nstays a real manifest key.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/cc08fd2f-407d-4fc1-9963-06089628fe87)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e536eaebd7a5a88365120df024efed59ce25654","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/7e536eaebd7a5a88365120df024efed59ce25654"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/260c33ee28ade91741ba226ef3e719b6b8c8c02c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYrI6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQhcQAEnlP1n/666SQF7gWCXejSxa\nlU4QQrHBedUd/perG2S5fVaOO+YmiPghUtYAB98DaU3KHEv4/HC4rSh4ZlBRRb32\nol/HfMFjXZQn34gDEVc7IWkHrxCewKdyXRQJt1oDyh5d0DpPdgGJpETm3zZyUtn8\nhdLXxpa8mVwrxKcoYPQETcD2YC8LkVaA91Pmj+l3IgsYwNR3jIcjNdQWsLphKw+S\nt3auL0hCS2tc2FfGeIyPdBDr4n1Yd/lOfKOn4efiHibIg2bzNRd61NCGj742vCm0\nFNVJ6TeUR2Ai6CTuYyy6RHkfCPxswQYayXGiR4KRk64nNq2B53ElUy2oxln7sTNy\nntgKXTku5htwJcHt13LvmyVAWsEJAO73l4AR8HsEKkTPmlGItu5jP0tZruspF4cq\n48lhNLjKpd9b766m2AmAfMG3MyoBSThzhdW56FZN61nDFOAM6j0vDNJVFvR2ei5m\nZfphulYEXXYWmr5mDFbNaTpmSEOl6Aa66F6I3QScA70dOK2RFS95zxmTup+n2Cty\nDo6kElpRDJTXKj95UmNPJodqk3lXMaRqjIJ3ywEmdf4KlOMtHWLZA6nzFasgGhij\njOmDcz4UoE7VNSXF3qP+7wXWtEA/jrnG+JW7LQ9BTqPaOHm6WB82T7SIAqCJLqSp\nAtXjl/cRysXSudpUJZvO\n=Zzfe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 7e536eaebd7a5a88365120df024efed59ce25654\nparent 4cf5b1583244275afcf2697b6cf9975395e5efd1\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784853050 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784853050 -0400\n\nfix(code): give `config get` a useful missing-key message (#4976)\n\nRunning `dcode config get` with no key now prints a hint that names an\nexample key and points at `dcode config` / `dcode config --verbose` to\ndiscover available keys, instead of argparse's terse \"the following\narguments are required: key\".\n\n---\n\nThe `key` positional on `config get` is now optional so the command\nhandler is reached even when it's omitted. In that case it renders a\nhuman-friendly hint (text) or returns the full key list under `error:\nmissing key` (JSON), mirroring the existing unknown-key guidance. The\nexit code stays `2`, matching argparse's prior usage-error convention so\nscripts see no change. A test guards that the example key in the hint\nstays a real manifest key.\n\nMade by [Open\nSWE](https://openswe.vercel.app/agents/cc08fd2f-407d-4fc1-9963-06089628fe87)\n\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <open-swe@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-24T00:30:50Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/260c33ee28ade91741ba226ef3e719b6b8c8c02c","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/260c33ee28ade91741ba226ef3e719b6b8c8c02c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/260c33ee28ade91741ba226ef3e719b6b8c8c02c/comments","author":{"login":"mdrxy","id":61371264,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzcxMjY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61371264?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy","html_url":"https://github.com/mdrxy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mdrxy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"4cf5b1583244275afcf2697b6cf9975395e5efd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/commits/4cf5b1583244275afcf2697b6cf9975395e5efd1","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/deepagents/commit/4cf5b1583244275afcf2697b6cf9975395e5efd1"}]},{"sha":"4cf5b1583244275afcf2697b6cf9975395e5efd1","node_id":"C_kwDOPTymldoAKDRjZjViMTU4MzI0NDI3NWFmY2YyNjk3YjZjZjk5NzUzOTVlNWVmZDE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Mason Daugherty","email":"mason@langchain.dev","date":"2026-07-24T00:30:36Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-24T00:30:36Z"},"message":"docs(infra): document CI credential boundaries (#5005)\n\nThe CI credential architecture now has a public target-state reference\ncovering GitHub environments, package-level injection, minimum provider\npermissions, migration, and rotation.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mason Daugherty <github@mdrxy.com>\nCo-authored-by: open-swe[bot] <215916821+open-swe[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5cf148793a6fcf7e0c0b341d6ece52fd3bd47ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/trees/e5cf148793a6fcf7e0c0b341d6ece52fd3bd47ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/deepagents/git/commits/4cf5b1583244275afcf2697b6cf9975395e5efd1","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYrIsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAo7IQAHMPKRf6KYLTbggTWBwocrbj\nU5Nk0pAoFNECQb/pt90ERVU3ekjZNFJ5EJIRnzKgnuYBno8Y+cugrrb83QOmyF5K\nxgmsN8Wgy7epRGXK802i1hg4fZtkSTe0dZM3Twgpz3yo23lLrEsrR3dru0YF3V2l\nAXQ3I/HFAEetJ4F3+iEZmMhupYT07dK0dxUj5D196IiYxuIphSUI/6NQrWwNKgu3\n0xidKmJUrxU62z5cyyV9XxtJCDmqx5PX4/nemPpB3CFsQ2wdOD9iyvhRIM73t/j+\nBEzPGKUy/lYEupekq898x+rJNgqOx/StdqNDuZx6YvYDnb6PYCBlwIorvTxM+JCZ\nO/J/Uts6HSbXVQh9l7A5195uCN4vt8CLwwxEfBrSLz7kPjcYHikZSRueZBsfeCD7\nicD8TPUf9pipl0Z809kRzgvxTz5kiCrNINdBq+UbjONIQObnqo5MAa6wLPUI7yAc\nhb0axkZd6G5FhoBhua+tufDliPt8TipCaUai5uhsEiysXbLHU36ARGq1CPcd+KOt\nKFMlyyHnHG2EtnZcHoA4cayxuzMpvwkRn9sZkR1tH+r7MSSGT7IDOG6ckmB+7itk\nZZV4DDSKI5yDxap4wj7aExoBUOyuyqidvtqhQHX3/0fs0vg8SDA7UInIzZ2PFP0a\nb+gXt1gv9KGH1JK1ZAhI\n=Yav2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree e5cf148793a6fcf7e0c0b341d6ece52fd3bd47ab\nparent f7922795d681d82bc2cfea8db0a292e7ecde0171\nauthor Mason Daugherty <mason@langchain.dev> 1784853036 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784853036 -0400\n\ndocs(infra): document CI credential boundaries (#5005)\n\nThe CI credential architecture now has a public target-state reference\ncovering GitHub environments, package-level injection, minimum provider\npermissions, migration, and rotation.\n\n--